WEBVTT

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:22.080
We believe the cause of death

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:24.580
to be the large laceration on his abdomen.

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:34.330
Is this the only corpse?

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:35.700
Yes.

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:40.540
It's been ten years...

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:42.910
Griffith.

00:02:12.950 --> 00:02:14.080
Thank you for waiting.

00:02:14.410 --> 00:02:17.750
Here are your meatballs with yogurt sauce
and mixed-grain pilaf!

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:20.700
You're Ilie, right? Where are you from?

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:22.500
Yeah, and how old are you?

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:24.950
Are you Mario's love child?

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:27.910
-No, she's Kidow's.
-What?

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.870
I'm 14! It wouldn't be possible!

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:32.410
Please enjoy.

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:38.040
It's nice having a girl around.

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:39.540
You said it.

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:43.120
It makes Mario's meals
taste ten times better.

00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:48.080
Then I guess I can charge you ten times...

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:50.370
No, how about 100 times more?

00:02:57.540 --> 00:03:00.290
Stay back.
It says "keep out" for a reason.

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:01.750
Okay, calm down.

00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:03.080
<i>Is it a Cagaster?</i>

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:04.080
<i>Unconfirmed.</i>

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:07.870
The man in the house
saw a Cagaster outbreak in person

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:11.700
and was so terrified
he hired an Exterminator.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:15.330
<i>I'm told that when the report came in,</i>

00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:17.830
<i>the man and his family's screams</i>
<i>could be heard.</i>

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:19.620
<i>We don't know their condition.</i>

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:23.830
I'll go in first. You're after me.
We clear?

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:29.500
<i>Don't be like that, Qasim. Mr. Kidow</i>
<i>is the Bazaar Overseer's favorite.</i>

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:31.830
What? This is war.

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:34.040
<i>Sir, please take the lead.</i>

00:03:34.830 --> 00:03:35.660
All right.

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:47.290
A bug! It's a bug!

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:09.750
They were bugs! They turned into bugs!

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:11.160
I swear!

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:13.450
I saw bug wings.

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:17.750
You have to believe me.
You have to check for me.

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:23.450
Scene secured. Three deceased.

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:26.080
One survivor. One unknown.

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:28.120
No Cagaster outbreak.

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:30.250
<i>Good work.</i>

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:32.660
No outbreak.

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:36.080
They say whatever gets
under a person's skin

00:04:36.370 --> 00:04:39.950
eats them more
than an actual Cagaster does.

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:43.120
<i>So, where...</i>

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:44.160
<i>is the Exterminator?</i>

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:48.500
This is unacceptable.

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:53.790
We're the E-05 Anti-Insect Tank Force,
directly under the Eastern Allied Forces.

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:56.660
Why do we have to take the backseat
to this Exterminator?

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:59.040
Completely unacceptable!

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.660
We'll leave the cleanup to you!

00:05:04.290 --> 00:05:06.080
Hey! Where are you going?

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:10.500
Sorry this little storage room
is all we have.

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:11.660
It's fine.

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:14.290
Don't you need to watch the restaurant?

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:17.790
Don't worry,
nobody's around this time of day.

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:21.750
More importantly, we need to clean this up
so you can have your own room.

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:22.660
Okay!

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:28.160
You're a big reader, Ms. Mario!

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:30.200
They're not mine, they're Kidow's.

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:32.450
What? All of these?

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:34.450
Yes, if he's not working,

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:36.540
he's either reading

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:39.290
or watching dirty videos.

00:05:39.790 --> 00:05:40.910
Dirty...?

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:46.950
You're so innocent, Ilie.

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:49.660
What a way to start the morning.

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:50.580
Nothing new.

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:52.910
Hungover?

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:54.500
No!

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:56.200
I get why you'd want to drink.

00:05:58.040 --> 00:05:59.410
This one's horrific.

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:03.200
I've never seen such
brutal remains like this.

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:06.370
Yeah, but this wasn't done by a bug.

00:06:06.950 --> 00:06:08.500
There's evidence of a sharp blade.

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:10.790
So, it was a human's doing?

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:16.750
If you can call someone who disembowels
and rips off limbs human.

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:19.580
Are you saying it wasn't a bug or a person
that did this?

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:21.500
Who can say?

00:06:22.370 --> 00:06:24.830
Could this be the work of a demon

00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:27.660
given life by the fear of a neighbor
becoming a bug?

00:06:27.870 --> 00:06:28.700
Or...

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:31.040
Blaming everything on the bugs

00:06:31.330 --> 00:06:32.790
isn't exactly healthy either.

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:36.750
So?

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.540
The corpses looked like meatballs.

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:45.290
If a bug killed them, there wouldn't be
a shred of meat left on them.

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:47.620
So, that wasn't a bug.

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:50.950
For someone who had
all their intestines pulled out,

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:52.870
there were too few bite marks.

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:55.370
Okay, we get it. That's enough.

00:06:57.910 --> 00:06:59.500
Thank you very much.

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:02.950
What got into them?

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:04.700
Goodness, you two...

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:06.000
I'm off.

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:09.040
Again? Business must be booming.

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:12.660
Maybe I should up your rent!

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:21.200
Why is the damn Exterminator here?

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:23.790
I was summoned. Here's the job request.

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:30.000
It has to be a fake!
I won't acknowledge this, Exterminator!

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:31.080
Let's all just--

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:39.120
The Bazaar Overseer is waiting.

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:43.120
Thank you for coming, Mr. Kidow!

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:46.700
I heard all about your brave actions
this morning!

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:48.250
Go on, fill your belly!

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:51.870
Much obliged!
I'll be taking you up on that offer!

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:02.200
Wow, this is delicious, Bazaar Overseer!

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:07.040
It's said Mr. Kidow

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:11.500
can finish an adult Cagaster
with a swing of his sword.

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:14.200
That's a bit of an exaggeration.

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:17.580
If you have a tank, then shooting it
is the smarter move.

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:21.580
In other words, all you need are our
Eastern Allied Forces' tanks!

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:25.330
Oh, you are so modest, Mr. Kidow.

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:27.830
You are no ordinary Exterminator.

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:31.450
I wish to entrust you with our next
caravan escort.

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:32.660
Have no fear!

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:35.500
You won't need Exterminators
as long as you have us!

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:36.540
Come on, now...

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:39.450
Please leave the escort mission to us,
Bazaar Overseer!

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:41.750
I'm counting on you, Mr. Kidow.

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:46.200
After all, the Far East Exterminators
are on a completely different level.

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:49.000
Far East?

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:52.660
Oh, maybe you don't know
since you're a country girl, Ilie.

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:55.870
I know a little bit!

00:08:56.950 --> 00:08:59.080
<i>The eastern habitable limit.</i>

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:02.200
<i>It's a desert that covers most of Asia.</i>

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:06.080
<i>And it's a hell with more insect cages</i>
<i>than towns.</i>

00:09:06.700 --> 00:09:08.290
<i>I see. Is that all?</i>

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:10.790
And...

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:14.500
Jin, stop bothering my girl.

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:16.040
I'll charge you extra.

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:19.830
Please no!
I'm not interested in little girls.

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:21.410
Little girl?

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:23.540
Could you take this over, Ilie?

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:25.700
Yeah, get to work,

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:27.200
newbie!

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:31.790
Here's your order!

00:09:32.330 --> 00:09:33.660
She seems well.

00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:36.540
Maybe she's moved on past her father.

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:37.450
Nope.

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:39.830
It's not that easy.

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:42.250
-Are you all right?
-She still cries at night.

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:44.910
She just has to get through it slowly.

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:46.450
I guess so.

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:50.500
So, why did you bring up the Far East?

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:54.950
Oh, she said she wanted to learn more
about Kidow.

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:57.120
Really? Ilie did?

00:09:58.040 --> 00:09:59.330
That's something.

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:02.830
Grandpa Murat!

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:07.620
Are you okay?
You always drink way too much!

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:09.790
I'll bring some water!

00:10:19.370 --> 00:10:22.790
Hey there, Mr. Far East Exterminator.

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:25.080
You looking to take
all the work here, too?

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:28.250
Some of us are losing our livelihoods
thanks to you.

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:31.120
Let's work together, seeing as we're all
in the same business.

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:36.660
All you gotta do is share
some of your earnings with us.

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:38.080
I see how it is.

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:43.290
"Please provide for us, Master Kidow,
because we are pathetically unemployed."

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:44.250
What?

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:46.660
You bastard!

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:53.120
Yeah! Get them, brother!

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:54.870
Kidow!

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:56.830
Don't, Ilie!

00:10:56.910 --> 00:10:58.120
But...

00:10:58.200 --> 00:10:59.250
What's all the fuss?

00:10:59.330 --> 00:11:01.750
-Ms. Mario! It's Kidow!
-What?

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:06.700
You!

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:14.950
You're dead!

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:15.910
Kidow!

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:30.450
My hand... My hand!

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:37.410
Ouch! It hurts!

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:41.700
My hand! You cut off my hand!

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:48.910
That's what they are!

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:50.410
An Exterminator

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:54.200
held my son down while he was in pain,
begging for his life,

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:57.000
and cut off his head,
all with a smile on his face!

00:11:57.370 --> 00:12:01.370
Saying how he just earned his
spending money for the month!

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:18.910
Damn that Kidow.

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:21.700
At this point, we should just
get him while he's sleeping!

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:25.040
What's that?

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:28.790
<i>...has lost her sheep</i>

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:37.120
<i>And can't tell where to find them</i>

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:41.450
Are you Exterminators, too?

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:43.750
Who the hell are you?

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:46.910
I'll be late tonight.

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:51.450
Tell Mario I won't need dinner.

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:12.000
Hey. What's all this about?

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:14.700
They found more mutilated corpses.

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:21.290
Hey, Naji!

00:14:21.370 --> 00:14:24.950
Today's the day
you enlist in our Team Red Rats!

00:14:25.040 --> 00:14:26.330
What does enlist mean?

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:29.370
You go against us, and you'll pay.

00:14:30.750 --> 00:14:33.160
Sorry, but I've got work.

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:35.120
Find someone else to play with.

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:38.370
We're not playing!
These are Lizzy's orders!

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:42.120
You know there's been some serious crimes
around here lately.

00:14:42.200 --> 00:14:44.790
Four people were cut to pieces this month.

00:14:44.870 --> 00:14:46.160
Cut to pieces?

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:49.040
You guys stay inside after dark, okay?

00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:53.910
Neither the military nor the vigilantes
are gonna protect us in the slums.

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:56.580
We'll be fine because we have Lizzy!

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:58.330
Seriously, you guys?

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:01.830
Keep it up and Qasim
will give you a beating!

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:05.250
That half-baked soldier ain't scary.

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:09.830
Tomorrow is the day you'll enlist with us,
Team Red Rats, Naji!

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:12.540
Later.

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:14.450
What does enlist mean?

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:15.830
Who knows?

00:15:17.790 --> 00:15:19.120
Here's your order.

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:22.080
Please enjoy your meal.

00:15:23.160 --> 00:15:25.000
Thank you.

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:28.870
What's up with Ilie?

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:31.870
Did something bad happen?

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:35.080
Kidow picked her up after her father died,
right?

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:37.950
Apparently, her father was killed.

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:42.160
To think she got sold to this fat-chinned
muscle-head after losing her family...

00:15:43.160 --> 00:15:46.200
Her father was killed,
and then she ends up here!

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:47.200
How terrible!

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:49.410
That's so heartbreaking!

00:15:49.750 --> 00:15:52.410
Guys, we all have to protect Ilie!

00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:54.410
Yeah!

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:56.540
Can't you just shut up and eat?

00:15:57.120 --> 00:15:58.830
We're sorry!

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:04.620
Ilie, have a sec?

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:12.250
Why don't you go rest?
You can't help customers like that.

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:14.790
Is something on your mind?

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:18.700
I don't know anything about Kidow.

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:19.750
What?

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:27.500
Oh, try not to be too scared of him, Ilie.

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:30.410
He's a kind soul.

00:16:31.250 --> 00:16:34.330
Even though he's tactless,
violent, and stupidly serious.

00:16:35.290 --> 00:16:37.540
He's nothing like other Exterminators.

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:44.040
So, you like Kidow, Ilie.

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:48.120
Well, it was pretty obvious.

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:50.580
Wanting to know more about someone

00:16:51.080 --> 00:16:53.200
is how love usually starts.

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:56.750
What? I never said I liked--

00:16:56.830 --> 00:16:59.870
Tell me, what do you like about Kidow?

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:01.790
His face? Of course you do!

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:04.250
That's about his only good quality.

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:07.250
Ilie, you're a sucker for the cute ones!

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:08.790
You're wrong!

00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:12.330
All right!

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:16.200
You see that?

00:17:16.330 --> 00:17:19.950
Witness the might of the Eastern Allied
Force's Anti-Insect Tank Force!

00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:21.700
What was that for?

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:23.450
Don't waste ammunition.

00:17:23.950 --> 00:17:25.410
You just provoked the bugs.

00:18:04.160 --> 00:18:07.500
Get off, you stupid pill bug!

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:22.330
Yeah!

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:23.660
Yes!

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:33.000
Why were there so many pill bugs
scurrying around?

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:40.200
The number of bugs is increasing?

00:18:40.580 --> 00:18:42.410
And at an alarming rate.

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:45.700
I just exterminated those bugs
two months ago,

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:48.250
and there were already that many larvae.

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:51.500
And in the middle of a trade route
to E-05.

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:54.500
We should take a different route home.

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:55.910
It'll take time,

00:18:56.250 --> 00:18:58.080
but it's better than fighting a horde.

00:18:58.620 --> 00:19:00.120
We're not taking any detours!

00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:03.830
Looks like you're just another
money-grubbing Exterminator

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:05.040
cowering from a fight.

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:08.080
We have to return to E-05

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:10.580
as soon as possible!

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:12.660
We welcome a fight against the bugs!

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:13.620
Now, now.

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:16.330
Let's do as he says. Okay?

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:26.160
Kidow...

00:19:32.410 --> 00:19:35.080
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

00:19:35.160 --> 00:19:38.160
-Good work today!
-I'm so tired.

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:40.620
Thanks, you, too.

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:47.620
Drinking alone,

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:48.580
sir?

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:50.500
What's that? Milk?

00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:52.790
Even you can be cute sometimes.

00:19:58.040 --> 00:20:00.040
The caravan values cooperation.

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:02.750
Could you at least
try to be more friendly?

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:04.500
That doesn't concern me.

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:09.000
Actually, a similar case happened in '03.

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:10.160
What's this, now?

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:12.750
The recent meatball case.

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:17.540
Several people have been mutilated
in the same way, by a sharp blade.

00:20:18.540 --> 00:20:21.450
And yet, there was evidence
they'd been eaten as well.

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:24.950
Every single victim was an Exterminator.

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:28.160
You should be careful.

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:30.120
Well,

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:33.950
I know you're not the kind of Exterminator
who's made enemies!

00:20:34.450 --> 00:20:35.540
Just want to be safe.

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:39.700
See you tomorrow, Mr. Kidow!

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:42.080
Yo, what's going on?

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:43.870
What are you doing? Get over here!

00:20:44.080 --> 00:20:45.750
Enemies, huh?

00:21:21.450 --> 00:21:25.120
I guess I'm an Exterminator killer, too.

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:27.830
Right, Dad?

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:32.370
<i>What's this about?</i>

00:21:32.870 --> 00:21:36.580
I ordered anchovies, so what's with
all these black lizards?

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:38.830
Because they're delicious?

00:21:38.910 --> 00:21:41.120
I've got another delivery
I need to get to!

00:21:42.290 --> 00:21:45.250
I'll see you next time! Bye!

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:49.080
I'll go buy anchovies!

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:51.120
They sell them at the Bazaar, right?

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:54.000
Are you okay to go alone?

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:55.160
I've got this!

00:21:55.250 --> 00:21:57.250
Okay, I guess I'll leave it to you.

00:21:57.620 --> 00:21:59.080
Here's some money.

00:22:00.870 --> 00:22:02.500
Let's see...

00:22:02.950 --> 00:22:04.620
From the lodging street,

00:22:05.500 --> 00:22:06.910
cross the bridge...

00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:09.870
The south bus loop via the South Gate

00:22:09.950 --> 00:22:11.700
will be leaving in five minutes.

00:22:17.200 --> 00:22:19.580
<i>Anchovies! Anchovies!</i>

00:22:19.660 --> 00:22:22.750
<i>Cross the bridge and through the alley!</i>

00:22:26.750 --> 00:22:28.790
He was in an awful hurry.

00:22:29.370 --> 00:22:30.200
Wait...

00:22:34.080 --> 00:22:36.450
Hey, you! Stop right there!

00:22:37.830 --> 00:22:40.410
Iason? What's he up to?

00:22:42.450 --> 00:22:44.620
I'm sorry! Oh, Naji!

00:22:44.700 --> 00:22:45.750
Ilie?

00:22:45.830 --> 00:22:46.790
The wallet!

00:22:46.870 --> 00:22:47.870
Ilie!

00:22:50.870 --> 00:22:52.830
Hey, what happened?

00:22:53.290 --> 00:22:56.620
The wallet! Anchovies! For Ms. Mario!

00:23:00.160 --> 00:23:01.040
This way.

00:23:02.330 --> 00:23:04.330
You know that boy, Naji?

00:23:04.580 --> 00:23:05.500
You could say that.

00:23:09.450 --> 00:23:10.500
Here we are.

00:23:11.910 --> 00:23:13.910
Good job, Iason.

00:23:14.250 --> 00:23:17.330
That's our hit-and-run leader
of the Team Red Rats!

00:23:22.540 --> 00:23:24.830
That's Ms. Mario's wallet!

00:23:26.620 --> 00:23:29.080
Is that right? Well, then,

00:23:29.160 --> 00:23:31.620
why don't I see her name on it,

00:23:32.160 --> 00:23:33.370
little lady?

00:25:35.160 --> 00:25:37.660
Subtitle translation by Zensho Yamamoto
